CHAMAKAM_CLOSING = "May Ida, who invokes the gods, who guides Manu's sacrifice, and Brihaspati recite the hymns and give joy. O Vishvedevas who speak the hymns, O Mother Earth, do not harm me. May I think sweetly, be born sweetly, speak sweetly and act sweetly. May I speak sweet words to the gods and words worth hearing to people. May the gods protect me for splendour, and may the ancestors rejoice."
